{
  "name": "GitHub PR & Issue Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "owner": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "DEIN-GITHUB-USERNAME"
        },
        "repository": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "DEIN-REPO-NAME"
        },
        "events": [
          "issues",
          "pull_request"
        ]
      },
      "id": "github-trigger",
      "name": "GitHub Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.githubTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "DEINE-GITHUB-CREDENTIAL-ID",
          "name": "GitHub API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "action-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
              "rightValue": "opened",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-opened",
      "name": "Nur bei opened",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-issue",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.issue }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "operation": "exists",
                      "singleValue": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "is-pr",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.pull_request }}",
                    "rightValue": "",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "operation": "exists",
                      "singleValue": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "switch-type",
      "name": "Issue oder PR?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        640,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Auto-Labeling für Issues basierend auf Titel\nconst title = ($input.first().json.body.issue?.title || '').toLowerCase();\n\nlet labels = ['needs-triage'];\n\nif (title.includes('bug') || title.includes('error') || title.includes('crash') || title.includes('broken') || title.includes('fehler')) {\n  labels = ['bug'];\n} else if (title.includes('feature') || title.includes('enhancement') || title.includes('add') || title.includes('implement') || title.includes('neue')) {\n  labels = ['enhancement'];\n} else if (title.includes('question') || title.includes('help') || title.includes('how') || title.includes('frage') || title.includes('hilfe')) {\n  labels = ['question'];\n} else if (title.includes('doc') || title.includes('readme') || title.includes('doku')) {\n  labels = ['documentation'];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    labels: labels,\n    issueNumber: $input.first().json.body.issue.number,\n    owner: $input.first().json.body.repository.owner.login,\n    repo: $input.first().json.body.repository.name,\n    title: $input.first().json.body.issue.title,\n    url: $input.first().json.body.issue.html_url\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-issue-labels",
      "name": "Issue Labels erkennen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "issue",
        "operation": "edit",
        "owner": "={{ $json.owner }}",
        "repository": "={{ $json.repo }}",
        "issueNumber": "={{ $json.issueNumber }}",
        "labels": "={{ $json.labels }}"
      },
      "id": "github-add-issue-labels",
      "name": "Issue Labels setzen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        280
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "DEINE-GITHUB-CREDENTIAL-ID",
          "name": "GitHub API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "issue",
        "operation": "createComment",
        "owner": "={{ $json.owner }}",
        "repository": "={{ $json.repo }}",
        "issueNumber": "={{ $json.issueNumber }}",
        "body": "=## Automatische Klassifizierung\n\nDieses Issue wurde automatisch mit dem Label **{{ $json.labels.join(', ') }}** versehen.\n\n---\n*Generiert von n8n*"
      },
      "id": "github-issue-comment",
      "name": "Issue Kommentar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        280
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "DEINE-GITHUB-CREDENTIAL-ID",
          "name": "GitHub API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Daten für PR vorbereiten\nconst pr = $input.first().json.body.pull_request;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    prNumber: pr.number,\n    owner: $input.first().json.body.repository.owner.login,\n    repo: $input.first().json.body.repository.name,\n    title: pr.title,\n    url: pr.html_url,\n    author: pr.user.login\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-pr-data",
      "name": "PR Daten vorbereiten",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "issue",
        "operation": "edit",
        "owner": "={{ $json.owner }}",
        "repository": "={{ $json.repo }}",
        "issueNumber": "={{ $json.prNumber }}",
        "labels": [
          "needs-review"
        ]
      },
      "id": "github-add-pr-label",
      "name": "PR Label needs-review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "DEINE-GITHUB-CREDENTIAL-ID",
          "name": "GitHub API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "accessToken",
        "resource": "issue",
        "operation": "createComment",
        "owner": "={{ $json.owner }}",
        "repository": "={{ $json.repo }}",
        "issueNumber": "={{ $json.prNumber }}",
        "body": "=## Pull Request Checkliste\n\nHallo @{{ $json.author }} 👋\n\nDanke für deinen PR! Bitte stelle sicher, dass folgendes erledigt ist:\n\n- [ ] Code ist getestet\n- [ ] Dokumentation aktualisiert (falls nötig)\n- [ ] Keine Secrets committed\n- [ ] CI-Checks sind grün\n\n---\n*Automatisch generiert von n8n*"
      },
      "id": "github-pr-comment",
      "name": "PR Kommentar mit Checkliste",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "githubApi": {
          "id": "DEINE-GITHUB-CREDENTIAL-ID",
          "name": "GitHub API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup-Anleitung\n\n1. **GitHub Credential anlegen** (Personal Access Token Classic mit Scopes: `repo`, `admin:repo_hook`)\n2. In den Nodes **Owner** und **Repository** anpassen\n3. Credential in allen GitHub-Nodes auswählen\n4. Workflow aktivieren → n8n erstellt automatisch den Webhook\n5. Labels im Repo anlegen: `bug`, `enhancement`, `question`, `documentation`, `needs-triage`, `needs-review`",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        80
      ]
    }
  ],
